            "review_title": "Review at Beer Garden - Craft Beer & Food",
            "review_text": "Klotschen444\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam16 contributions\n0\nMy best local experience in Buon ma Thuot.\nOct 2022 • Business\nI come here frequently as I am visiting this city several times a year for business purpose. I never was dissppointed. Apart from the great beer from Heart of Darness Brewery they serve a very good quality of local and international dishes. The frog legs and river shrimps are worth trying! Also the wagyu beef steak and german style sausage are great! But dont expect english speaking staff!! This place is 100% local...\nRead more\nWritten October 29, 2022",
